@startuml seq-nominal
' Happy path: order placed → delivery completed

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #fafafa
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #bbbbbb
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title Nominal flow — order placed to delivery completed\n(all client calls pass through gateway; omitted for clarity)

actor Customer
actor Courier
participant "order" as Order
participant "dispatch" as Dispatch
participant "tracking" as Tracking
participant "payment" as Payment
participant "notification" as Notification

autonumber

== Order creation ==

Customer -> Order : POST /orders\n{type, pickupPoint, dropOffPoint}
activate Order
Order --> Customer : 202 Accepted {orderId, status: PLACED}
Order ->> Payment : event: OrderConfirmed
Order ->> Notification : event: OrderConfirmed
deactivate Order
Notification -> Customer : push: order confirmed

== Simulated merchant ==

note over Order
  Simulated merchant (internal component of order service):
  auto-confirms and declares ready after a configurable delay
  (MER-01 + MER-02). No external interface in V1.
end note
Order -> Order : [sim] PLACED → CONFIRMED → READY
Order ->> Dispatch : event: OrderReady {deliveryId, pickupPoint}

== Dispatch ==

activate Dispatch
Dispatch -> Dispatch : query CourierSnapshot (PostGIS):\navailable couriers near pickupPoint,\nordered by score (ADR 0008)
Dispatch -> Dispatch : create Offer for top candidate\n{courierId, deadline}
Dispatch ->> Notification : event: OfferCreated {courierId}
deactivate Dispatch
Notification -> Courier : push: new offer

== Offer accepted ==

Courier -> Dispatch : POST /offers/{id}/accept
activate Dispatch
Dispatch -> Dispatch : Offer → ACCEPTED
Dispatch ->> Order : event: DeliveryAssigned {deliveryId, courierId}
Dispatch ->> Notification : event: DeliveryAssigned
deactivate Dispatch

activate Order
Order -> Order : Delivery → ASSIGNED
Order --> Courier : 200 OK
deactivate Order
Notification -> Customer : push: courier assigned

== Live tracking ==

note over Courier, Tracking
  Courier posts position every ~5 s (COU-05 / SIM).
  tracking stores the raw position, pushes an SSE update to the
  customer app, and publishes CourierPositionSampled every 15 s
  to dispatch (to keep CourierSnapshot current).
end note

Courier -> Tracking : POST /positions {point, reportedAt, key}
Tracking -> Customer : SSE: {point, eta}
Tracking ->> Dispatch : event: CourierPositionSampled

== Pickup ==

Courier -> Order : POST /deliveries/{id}/pickup
activate Order
Order -> Order : Delivery → PICKED_UP\nOrder → IN_PROGRESS
Order ->> Notification : event: PickupConfirmed
Order --> Courier : 200 OK
deactivate Order
Notification -> Customer : push: courier has picked up

...

== Delivery ==

Courier -> Order : POST /deliveries/{id}/deliver
activate Order
Order -> Order : Delivery → DELIVERED\nOrder → COMPLETED
Order ->> Notification : event: DeliveryCompleted
Order --> Courier : 200 OK
deactivate Order
Notification -> Customer : push: order delivered

== Payment (concurrent) ==

note over Payment
  Payment completes independently:
  PaymentRecord transitions PENDING → PAID
  when the simulated provider callback fires.
  May arrive before or after delivery.
  See seq-payment diagram.
end note
Payment ->> Order : event: PaymentCompleted
@enduml
